<p>Heh, point taken. Although it would be interesting to find out it's just a complicated ore mill that works without any noise or vibration, or even a furnace that expels no smoke, thus destroying all equipment you put into it. Why? Because it processes it all in a pocket dimension/alternate magical world/workshop of the gods/the refinery that the Factory uses to get its processed resources, which also keeps sending the replacement materials.</p>
